IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `kr-ai-domain`
IMPORT `kr-ai-operator`
IMPORT `kr-ai-baseline`

-- Korea: Framework Act on the Development of Artificial Intelligence and
-- Establishment of Trust, with its Enforcement Decree -- INDEPENDENT TESTS.
-- A DRAFT. Not for use as advice. No domain expert and no lawyer qualified in
-- Korea has read this encoding or these tests against the source.
--
-- Written by a session that did not see the encoding being built. Every expected
-- value was decided from the deposited Korean texts (kr-ai-act-ko.txt,
-- kr-ai-decree-ko.txt, kr-ai-decree-annex2-ko.txt) and written down in
-- tests-independent-answers-first.md BEFORE the encoding was opened; the baseline
-- was then read only to learn its names and inputs. Section (9) of that file
-- (Article 31(1)) was decided after the baseline was opened, from the source.
-- No expectation was adjusted to match the code. A failing assertion here is a
-- finding, left failing on purpose, with a comment naming the provision.
-- Locators: act:N, decree:N, annex2:N are line N of those text files.
-- Money in won; Annex 2 prints 만원 (10,000 won).
--
-- RECONCILIATION (step E, written after reading NOTES.md and kr-ai-tests.l4).
-- Every assertion below is satisfied: on every question the baseline exports,
-- the answers decided from the source agree with the encoding. Where the
-- answers-first file and the encoding still differ, or the baseline cannot be
-- asked, from the source:
-- 1. Date. Answers-first (6): before 2026-01-22 no duty under Arts 31, 32 or 36
--    was in force (act:392, act:405, decree:388). Only the commencement question
--    takes a date; the Art 32, 36, 31(1) and incident questions answer the same
--    for any date. Untestable here; the encoding says so in its header.
-- 2. Delegation (answers-first F2, not in the encoding's fork register). Act Art
--    32(1) (act:333) delegates only "a standard of cumulative training compute";
--    Decree Art 24(1) items 2-3 (decree:304-305) add two non-compute criteria.
--    Both the encoding and these tests take the Decree as written; whether items
--    2-3 are within the delegation is open.
-- 3. Scope of an Art 40(3) order (answers-first F6, not registered). act:381
--    says an investigation may end in an order on any breach of "이 법"; the
--    encoding's comment takes that reading, but its finding 5 ("fines failures ...
--    that its own fact-finding power does not reach") is true only of OPENING an
--    investigation. No exported question asks about orders; untestable.
-- 4. Support for the encoding's F5 (a utilisation operator is bound by Art 32).
--    Decree Art 27(3) (decree:339) relieves a utilisation operator of Art 34(1)
--    items 1-3 where its developer did them and it made no major change, which
--    presupposes duties addressed to 인공지능사업자 reach utilisation operators;
--    Decree Art 24 gives no such relief for Art 32.
-- 5. Coverage rows the encoding's NOTES read only by heading: Decree Art 5(1)
--    (decree:74) lets the Committee REQUEST materials from 법인 (an operator may be
--    one); no duty to comply is stated, so the "no reporting duty" answer stands.
-- 6. Not exposed by the baseline, so untested: no fine for failing to report
--    (신고) a designation (act:388); the 36(3) deeming (act:359); Decree Art 25's
--    30/30/10-day confirmation clocks (decree:318-322); Art 2(4)라's 2026-01-24
--    commencement (act:392); answers-first F8 (internal-only AI use) is pushed
--    into the input "I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI".
-- Negative controls, 2026-10-24, on scratch copies of kr-ai-operator.l4 (discarded):
-- threshold literal moved to 10^26 + 1: 10 of these assertions fail; Annex 2 item 1
-- first-order amount 5,000,000 -> 50,000,000: 5 fail; Article 36's no-office
-- condition replaced by TRUE: 2 fail; 32(2) dropped from Article 40(1)'s list: 1 fails.

§ `Independent fixtures`

-- Decree Art 24(1) item 1 (decree:303): 10의 26승 부동소수점연산 이상.
`indep: 10^26` MEANS 100000000000000000000000000
`indep: 10^26 minus 1` MEANS 99999999999999999999999999
`indep: 10^26 plus 1` MEANS 100000000000000000000000001
`indep: 10^27` MEANS 1000000000000000000000000000
`indep: 10^25` MEANS 10000000000000000000000000

-- Decree Art 29(1) (decree:353-355): 1조원, 100억원, 100만명.
`indep: 1 trillion won` MEANS 1000000000000
`indep: 1 trillion won minus 1` MEANS 999999999999
`indep: 10 billion won` MEANS 10000000000
`indep: 10 billion won minus 1` MEANS 9999999999
`indep: 1,000,000 users` MEANS 1000000
`indep: 999,999 users` MEANS 999999

GIVETH A DATE
`indep: 2025-01-21` MEANS Date 21 1 2025
GIVETH A DATE
`indep: 2026-01-21` MEANS Date 21 1 2026
GIVETH A DATE
`indep: 2026-01-22` MEANS Date 22 1 2026
GIVETH A DATE
`indep: 2026-10-24` MEANS Date 24 10 2026

-- Shorthands over the baseline's exported Article 32 question. Each fixes the
-- operator's facts and leaves the system's three Decree Art 24(1) facts open.
-- A Korean developer that provides its AI in Korea.
GIVEN compute IS A NUMBER
      advanced IS A BOOLEAN
      risky IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Safety obligation answer`
`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` compute advanced risky MEANS
    `Does the Article 32 safety obligation apply to my AI system` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE compute advanced risky

-- A foreign developer acting only abroad, whose conduct affects Korean users (Art 4(1)).
GIVEN compute IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Safety obligation answer`
`indep: Article 32 for a foreign developer reaching Korea` compute MEANS
    `Does the Article 32 safety obligation apply to my AI system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE compute TRUE TRUE

-- Shorthand over the baseline's exported Article 36 question: an operator
-- (developer) acting abroad, affecting Korea, not defence-only; office and the
-- four Decree Art 29(1) facts open.
GIVEN office IS A BOOLEAN
      revenue IS A NUMBER
      `ai revenue` IS A NUMBER
      users IS A NUMBER
      fined IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Domestic representative answer`
`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` office revenue `ai revenue` users fined MEANS
    `Must I designate a domestic representative` TRUE TRUE FALSE office FALSE TRUE FALSE revenue `ai revenue` users fined

§ `(1) Does the Article 32 safety obligation bind me?`

-- All three Decree Art 24(1) criteria (모두 충족, decree:302); compute "이상" (at or above).
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26 plus 1` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26 minus 1` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^25` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))
-- Compute above the line but criterion 2 (most advanced) or 3 (broad, serious risk) fails: not bound.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^27` FALSE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^27` TRUE FALSE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^27` FALSE FALSE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))
-- Criteria 2 and 3 met but compute below: not bound.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` 0 TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))
-- When bound: both items of 32(1) and the 32(2) submission; no period stated (act:336, decree:302-306).
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE)'s `I must identify, assess and mitigate risks across the AI life cycle`
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE)'s `I must build a risk-management system that monitors and responds to AI safety incidents`
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE)'s `I must submit the results of those measures to the Minister of Science and ICT`
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE)'s `within how many days the results must be submitted` EQUALS NOTHING
-- When not bound: none of the duties.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26 minus 1` TRUE TRUE)'s `I must submit the results of those measures to the Minister of Science and ICT`))
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^27` TRUE FALSE)'s `I must build a risk-management system that monitors and responds to AI safety incidents`))
-- The whole answer, bound and unbound.
#ASSERT `indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `Safety obligation answer` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING
#ASSERT `indep: Article 32 for a Korean developer` `indep: 10^26 minus 1` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `Safety obligation answer` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING
-- Fork F1, reading A (literal "인공지능사업자", act:333): a utilisation operator using another's frontier model is bound.
#ASSERT (`Does the Article 32 safety obligation apply to my AI system` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`
-- Not an AI business operator (Art 2(7), act:24): not bound, whatever the system.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Does the Article 32 safety obligation apply to my AI system` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Does the Article 32 safety obligation apply to my AI system` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))
-- Foreign reach (Art 4(1), act:37): acting abroad, affecting Korea: bound.
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a foreign developer reaching Korea` `indep: 10^26`)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`
-- Acting abroad with no effect on the Korean market or users: the Act does not reach it.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Does the Article 32 safety obligation apply to my AI system` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))
-- Defence/security-only AI (Art 4(2), Decree Art 2; act:38, decree:18): excluded.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Does the Article 32 safety obligation apply to my AI system` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `Article 32 binds me for this system`))

§ `(2) Any duty to report an AI incident?`

-- No provision of the Act or the Decree requires an operator to report an incident (answers-first (2)).
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `a duty to report an AI incident is stated in the Act or the Decree`))
#ASSERT (`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `to whom an incident must be reported` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `within how many days an incident must be reported` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not even for the largest system, and not for a small one.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^25` FALSE FALSE)'s `a duty to report an AI incident is stated in the Act or the Decree`))
#ASSERT (`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^25` FALSE FALSE)'s `within how many days an incident must be reported` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Nearest duty (crosswalk): Art 32(1)2 + 32(2) for a bound system (act:335-336); none otherwise.
#ASSERT (`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE)'s `the nearest duty` EQUALS `Article 32(1) item 2 and Article 32(2): build a risk-management system that monitors and responds to AI safety incidents, and submit the results of the Article 32(1) measures to the Minister; neither is a duty to report an incident`
#ASSERT (`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^26 minus 1` TRUE TRUE)'s `the nearest duty` EQUALS `none for this system: Article 32 does not bind it, and no provision of the Act or the Decree requires any operator to report an incident`
#ASSERT (`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^27` TRUE FALSE)'s `the nearest duty` EQUALS `none for this system: Article 32 does not bind it, and no provision of the Act or the Decree requires any operator to report an incident`
#ASSERT (`Must I report a serious AI incident` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `the nearest duty` EQUALS `none: the Act does not bind this operator for this conduct (Article 2(7), Article 4)`
#ASSERT (`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE `indep: 10^27` TRUE TRUE)'s `the nearest duty` EQUALS `none: the Act does not bind this operator for this conduct (Article 2(7), Article 4)`
-- A foreign developer reaching Korea with a bound system: the same nearest duty, still no report.
#ASSERT (`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE)'s `the nearest duty` EQUALS `Article 32(1) item 2 and Article 32(2): build a risk-management system that monitors and responds to AI safety incidents, and submit the results of the Article 32(1) measures to the Minister; neither is a duty to report an incident`
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Must I report a serious AI incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE `indep: 10^26` TRUE TRUE)'s `a duty to report an AI incident is stated in the Act or the Decree`))

§ `(3) What must I submit under Article 32, and by when?`

-- Covered in (1): the results of both 32(1) items, to the Minister; no period stated.
-- A foreign operator reaching Korea is in the same position.
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a foreign developer reaching Korea` `indep: 10^26`)'s `I must submit the results of those measures to the Minister of Science and ICT`
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a foreign developer reaching Korea` `indep: 10^26`)'s `within how many days the results must be submitted` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 32 for a foreign developer reaching Korea` `indep: 10^26 minus 1`)'s `within how many days the results must be submitted` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `(4) Domestic representative (Act Art 36, Decree Art 29)`

-- No office in Korea; criterion 1, total revenue 1조원 이상 (decree:353): at, and one won below.
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE `indep: 1 trillion won` 0 0 FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE `indep: 1 trillion won minus 1` 0 0 FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`))
-- Criterion 2, AI-service revenue 100억원 이상 (decree:354), with total revenue below 1조.
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE 500000000000 `indep: 10 billion won` 0 FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE 500000000000 `indep: 10 billion won minus 1` 0 FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`))
-- Criterion 3, average daily users in Korea 100만명 이상 (decree:355).
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE 0 0 `indep: 1,000,000 users` FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE 0 0 `indep: 999,999 users` FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`))
-- Criterion 4, a past fine under Art 43(1)3 (decree:356), with no size criterion met.
#ASSERT (`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE 0 0 0 TRUE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`
-- All four just below: no duty.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE `indep: 1 trillion won minus 1` `indep: 10 billion won minus 1` `indep: 999,999 users` FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`))
-- An address or office in Korea: no Art 36 duty, whatever the size (act:354).
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` TRUE `indep: 1 trillion won` `indep: 10 billion won` `indep: 1,000,000 users` TRUE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`))
#ASSERT (NOT ((`indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` TRUE `indep: 1 trillion won` 0 0 FALSE)'s `I must report the designation to the Minister of Science and ICT`))
-- Designate in writing AND report (신고) to the Minister; no period for either.
#ASSERT `indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE `indep: 1 trillion won` 0 0 FALSE EQUALS `Domestic representative answer` TRUE TRUE NOTHING
#ASSERT `indep: Article 36 for a developer reaching Korea` FALSE 0 0 `indep: 999,999 users` FALSE EQUALS `Domestic representative answer` FALSE FALSE NOTHING
-- Not an AI business operator: no duty (Art 36(1) addresses 인공지능사업자).
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Must I designate a domestic representative` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE `indep: 1 trillion won` 0 0 FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`))
-- A utilisation operator abroad with 100만 daily users in Korea: must designate.
#ASSERT (`Must I designate a domestic representative` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE 0 0 `indep: 1,000,000 users` FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`
-- No address or office in Korea, but acting in Korea (e.g. selling in from abroad through its own conduct): the size criteria decide.
#ASSERT (`Must I designate a domestic representative` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 0 `indep: 10 billion won` 0 FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`
-- No office, large, but neither acting in Korea nor affecting it (Art 4(1)): the Act does not reach it.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Must I designate a domestic representative` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `indep: 1 trillion won` 0 0 FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`))
-- Defence/security-only AI (Art 4(2)): excluded.
#ASSERT (NOT ((`Must I designate a domestic representative` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE `indep: 1 trillion won` 0 0 FALSE)'s `I must designate a domestic representative in writing`))

§ `(5) What can the Minister do to me; the route to a fine; the amounts`

-- Art 40(1) triggers (act:378-379): 31(2), 31(3), 32(1), 32(2), 34(1).
#ASSERT `Can the Minister investigate me over a suspected breach of` `Article 31(2), marking generative AI output` EQUALS `Article 40(1) and (2): the Minister may require me to submit materials, or have officials investigate, including entering my offices to inspect records and things`
#ASSERT `Can the Minister investigate me over a suspected breach of` `Article 31(3), notice or marking of realistic synthetic output` EQUALS `Article 40(1) and (2): the Minister may require me to submit materials, or have officials investigate, including entering my offices to inspect records and things`
#ASSERT `Can the Minister investigate me over a suspected breach of` `Article 32(1), the safety measures` EQUALS `Article 40(1) and (2): the Minister may require me to submit materials, or have officials investigate, including entering my offices to inspect records and things`
#ASSERT `Can the Minister investigate me over a suspected breach of` `Article 32(2), submitting the results to the Minister` EQUALS `Article 40(1) and (2): the Minister may require me to submit materials, or have officials investigate, including entering my offices to inspect records and things`
#ASSERT `Can the Minister investigate me over a suspected breach of` `Article 34(1), measures for high-impact AI` EQUALS `Article 40(1) and (2): the Minister may require me to submit materials, or have officials investigate, including entering my offices to inspect records and things`
-- Not triggers: 31(1) and 36(1) (direct fines instead), 33(1) (no fine, no trigger).
#ASSERT `Can the Minister investigate me over a suspected breach of` `Article 31(1), prior notice to users` EQUALS `Article 40(1) does not list this provision: a suspected breach of it does not trigger the Article 40 fact-finding power`
#ASSERT `Can the Minister investigate me over a suspected breach of` `Article 33(1), reviewing whether AI is high-impact` EQUALS `Article 40(1) does not list this provision: a suspected breach of it does not trigger the Article 40 fact-finding power`
#ASSERT `Can the Minister investigate me over a suspected breach of` `Article 36(1), designating a domestic representative` EQUALS `Article 40(1) does not list this provision: a suspected breach of it does not trigger the Article 40 fact-finding power`

-- Art 32 failures are not fined directly; only after an Art 40(3) order (act:386-389).
#ASSERT `Can I be fined directly for not carrying out Article 32` `indep: 2026-10-24` EQUALS `not fined directly: Article 43(1) does not list Article 32; after an Article 40 investigation the Minister may order a breach suspended or corrected (Article 40(3)), and not carrying out that order is finable under Article 43(1) item 3`

-- Annex 2 individual criteria (annex2:36-44), 만원 x 10,000 = won.
-- 가. Art 31(1) notice: 500 / 1,000 / 1,500 만원.
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 0 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 5000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 1 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 10000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 2 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 15000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 3 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 15000000
-- 나. Art 36(1) representative: 2,000 만원 at every order.
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 2: not designating a domestic representative as Article 36(1) requires` 0 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 20000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 2: not designating a domestic representative as Article 36(1) requires` 1 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 20000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 2: not designating a domestic representative as Article 36(1) requires` 2 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 20000000
-- 다. Art 40(3) order: 1,000 / 2,000 / 3,000 만원.
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 0 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 10000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 1 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 20000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 2 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 30000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 3 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 30000000
-- Order (annex2:3-10): the next after the highest in the last two years; 3 is "third or later".
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 0 FALSE)'s `order of this violation` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 1 FALSE)'s `order of this violation` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 2 FALSE)'s `order of this violation` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 3 FALSE)'s `order of this violation` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 7 FALSE)'s `the fine Annex 2 sets, in won` EQUALS 15000000
-- Ceiling, 3천만원 (act:386).
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 0 FALSE)'s `the ceiling Article 43(1) sets, in won` EQUALS 30000000
-- Increase by up to one half, never above the ceiling (annex2:22-25).
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 0 FALSE)'s `the most the Minister may impose by increasing it, in won` EQUALS 7500000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 2 FALSE)'s `the most the Minister may impose by increasing it, in won` EQUALS 22500000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 2: not designating a domestic representative as Article 36(1) requires` 0 FALSE)'s `the most the Minister may impose by increasing it, in won` EQUALS 30000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 0 FALSE)'s `the most the Minister may impose by increasing it, in won` EQUALS 15000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 1 FALSE)'s `the most the Minister may impose by increasing it, in won` EQUALS 30000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 2 FALSE)'s `the most the Minister may impose by increasing it, in won` EQUALS 30000000
-- Reduce by up to one half, but not for one in arrears with a fine (annex2:11-13).
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 0 FALSE)'s `the least the Minister may impose by reducing it, in won` EQUALS 2500000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 2: not designating a domestic representative as Article 36(1) requires` 0 FALSE)'s `the least the Minister may impose by reducing it, in won` EQUALS 10000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 2 FALSE)'s `the least the Minister may impose by reducing it, in won` EQUALS 15000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 0 TRUE)'s `the least the Minister may impose by reducing it, in won` EQUALS 5000000
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)` 2 TRUE)'s `the least the Minister may impose by reducing it, in won` EQUALS 30000000
-- Arrears bars only the reduction, not the increase.
#ASSERT (`What is the fine for this failure` `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires` 0 TRUE)'s `the most the Minister may impose by increasing it, in won` EQUALS 7500000
-- No adjusted amount ever exceeds the ceiling.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD all (GIVEN n YIELD (`What is the fine for this failure` f n FALSE)'s `the most the Minister may impose by increasing it, in won` AT MOST 30000000) (LIST 0, 1, 2, 3)) (LIST `Article 43(1) item 1: not giving the prior notice Article 31(1) requires`, `Article 43(1) item 2: not designating a domestic representative as Article 36(1) requires`, `Article 43(1) item 3: not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3)`)

§ `(6) Grace period, and commencement`

#ASSERT `Does the law give me a grace period` `indep: 2026-10-24` EQUALS `none in law: the Act, the Decree and Annex 2 contain no grace period and no suspension of investigations or fines; a grace period announced by the government, if any, is policy, not law, and was not read`
#ASSERT `Does the law give me a grace period` `indep: 2026-01-22` EQUALS `none in law: the Act, the Decree and Annex 2 contain no grace period and no suspension of investigations or fines; a grace period announced by the government, if any, is policy, not law, and was not read`
-- Act No. 20676 addendum Art 1 (act:392): one year after promulgation on 2025-01-21, i.e. 2026-01-22; act:405 and decree:388 agree.
#ASSERT `Were the Act and the Decree in force` `indep: 2025-01-21` EQUALS `not yet in force`
#ASSERT `Were the Act and the Decree in force` `indep: 2026-01-21` EQUALS `not yet in force`
#ASSERT `Were the Act and the Decree in force` `indep: 2026-01-22` EQUALS `in force`
#ASSERT `Were the Act and the Decree in force` `indep: 2026-10-24` EQUALS `in force`

§ `(7) Who is an AI business operator; foreign reach`

-- Art 2(7) (act:24-26): AI-industry business AND (develops and provides AI, OR provides AI products/services using a developer's AI).
#ASSERT `Am I an AI business operator` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I an AI business operator` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I an AI business operator` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT (NOT (`Am I an AI business operator` TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT (NOT (`Am I an AI business operator` FALSE TRUE TRUE))
-- Art 4 (act:37-38; decree:18).
#ASSERT `Does the Act reach my conduct` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the Act reach my conduct` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `Does the Act reach my conduct` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT (NOT (`Does the Act reach my conduct` FALSE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT (NOT (`Does the Act reach my conduct` TRUE TRUE TRUE))

§ `(9) Article 31(1) prior notice (decided after the baseline was opened)`

-- Generative AI service, not obvious, not internal: must notify (act:329).
#ASSERT `Must I tell users in advance that my product or service runs on AI` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
-- High-impact AI: must notify.
#ASSERT `Must I tell users in advance that my product or service runs on AI` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
-- Neither high-impact nor generative: no duty.
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must I tell users in advance that my product or service runs on AI` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- Decree 23(4)1 (obvious) and 23(4)2 (internal only), fork F10 reading A: no duty.
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must I tell users in advance that my product or service runs on AI` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must I tell users in advance that my product or service runs on AI` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
-- Not an operator, or out of reach: no duty.
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must I tell users in advance that my product or service runs on AI` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT (NOT (`Must I tell users in advance that my product or service runs on AI` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
